## Cross-Cutting Concerns

### Authentication & Credential Management
- **Where**: `.env` file (never committed to repo)
- **What**: `GEN_AI_API_KEY`, `GEN_AI_URL`, `RAG_API_KEY`, `RAG_URL`
- **Pattern**: Read via `os.getenv()` at runtime; never hardcode
- **Rotation**: User responsibility; system reads current values on each run

### Error Handling Policy (per pipeline stage)
| Error Class | Action |
|---|---|
| Transient (429, 5xx, timeouts) | Exponential backoff + jitter, max 3–6 attempts, respect `retry-after` header |
| Permanent (401, 403, 404) | Surface to user with actionable next step; do NOT retry |
| Validation failures | Surface to user; halt that stage; allow pipeline to continue if optional |
| Idempotency violations | Log error; persist idempotency key on mutating calls; avoid double-retry |

### Data Contamination Check (optional)
- **Trigger**: `EVAL_CONTAMINATION_CHECK` flag in `.env` (default: true)
- **Process**: Embed generated questions + input material; compute semantic similarity; if > threshold, diversify questions and surface percentage in report
- **Output**: "estimated overlap: X%" in the final report

### Observability & Logging
- **Per-stage logging**: input_summary → output_status → success/failure + error_class
- **Run-level tracing**: single ID propagated through all stages; enables end-to-end debug
- **Metrics dashboard**: success rate per stage, error distribution, metric distributions, contamination percentage
- **Idempotency keys**: on any mutating operation (question regeneration, material re-chunking)

### Extensibility Hooks
| What can change | How it's configured |
|---|---|
| Chunking strategy | `.env`: `CHUNK_SIZE`, `CHUNK_OVERLAP`; code change to switch splitter type |
| Question-generation AI | `.env`: `GEN_AI_API_KEY`, `GEN_AI_URL`; model name in prompt |
| Target RAG endpoint | `.env`: `RAG_API_KEY`, `RAG_URL`; endpoint URL + auth headers |
| Evaluation metrics | Code change: add new metric to schema + compute logic; document in PRD.md Section 9 |
| Question types/difficulty | `.env` or runtime config; extend schema, add mapping tables |
| GUI framework | Configuration; swap implementation without changing pipeline logic |

