## Quick-Start Checklist (for the implementing engineer)

- [ ] Verify `docs/PRD.md` and `docs/architecture.md` are in place and up to date
- [ ] Verify `flaw.md` exists and cross-references PRD.md Section 9
- [ ] Create `.env.example` with all required vars documented (GITIGNORE it)
- [ ] Implement Stage 1–2: material ingest + chunking with `.env`-configurable params
- [ ] Implement Stage 3: question generation with AI API key from `.env`
- [ ] Implement Stage 4: mandatory user review gate (TUI or GUI)
- [ ] Implement Stage 5: translation step (configurable language)
- [ ] Implement Stage 6: answer generation with RAG API key from `.env`; error handling per policy
- [ ] Implement Stage 7: before/after rerank check
- [ ] Implement Stage 8: JSON dataset assembly per schema
- [ ] Implement Stage 9: GUI or TUI interface for full workflow
- [ ] Add observability: per-stage logging, run-level tracing, metrics dashboard skeletons
- [ ] Write unit tests for each stage in isolation
- [ ] Run end-to-end test with sample material and mock APIs
- [ ] Document known limitations in PRD.md Section 9 (research flaws) and flaw.md
- [ ] Set calendar reminder for 3-month re-evaluation of flaws vs. new research

